WEBVTT

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:03.610
Everyone, Kaleido Star is about to start!

00:00:03.610 --> 00:00:06.440
When watching Kaleido Star,
please keep the room brightly lit,

00:00:06.440 --> 00:00:09.210
and sit as far from the TV as you can.

00:00:11.650 --> 00:00:14.380
I'm Sora Naegino.
I came to America all by myself

00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:15.920
with aspirations of joining Kaleido Stage.

00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:17.650
Everything is new to me,

00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:21.020
but I'm doing my best in the spirit of
"try it rather than think about it."

00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:22.530
There's nothing I can't do if I try

00:00:22.530 --> 00:00:24.330
and if I can do it without trying,
I'd be super lucky.

00:00:24.330 --> 00:00:27.190
And if I'm gonna do it, I just gotta do it!
Gotta! Gotta! That's me.

00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:34.200
Well, well, well, what would you do if
you have to do something super hard?

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:36.910
When everyone says that
you don't have a chance.

00:00:36.910 --> 00:00:38.940
It's very tough.

00:00:38.940 --> 00:00:42.380
But you want to at least believe
in yourself, you know?

00:00:42.380 --> 00:00:44.480
So, even in a pinch, let's change that
into an opportunity!

00:00:44.480 --> 00:00:46.180
Let's change it! Let's change it!

00:01:02.570 --> 00:01:05.660
<i>Yaritai koto wa nani</i>

00:01:02.570 --> 00:01:05.660
<i>What is it that you want to do?</i>

00:01:06.170 --> 00:01:09.330
<i>Sou kikareru tabi</i>

00:01:06.170 --> 00:01:09.330
<i>Every time I was asked that</i>

00:01:10.040 --> 00:01:13.070
<i>Aoi sora miageta</i>

00:01:10.040 --> 00:01:13.070
<i>I looked up at the blue sky</i>

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:17.080
<i>Kotae wa only my heart</i>

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:17.080
<i>The answer is only in my heart</i>

00:01:17.080 --> 00:01:24.590
<i>Honto ni daiji na kotoba wa
kantan ni wa iwanai</i>

00:01:17.080 --> 00:01:24.590
<i>I don't easily say the words
that are really important</i>

00:01:24.590 --> 00:01:31.890
<i>Hikari ga yubisasu basho e to hashiridasu yo</i>

00:01:24.590 --> 00:01:31.890
<i>I start running towards the place
the light points to</i>

00:01:31.890 --> 00:01:39.840
<i>Dakishimetai mono nara
nakitai hodo mune ni aru</i>

00:01:31.890 --> 00:01:39.840
<i>There's so much in my heart that I want
to embrace, I could cry</i>

00:01:39.840 --> 00:01:46.810
<i>Egakitsuzukete yuku kitto
take it someday</i>

00:01:39.840 --> 00:01:46.810
<i>I'll keep painting my way, I promise,
take it someday</i>

00:01:46.810 --> 00:01:54.780
<i>Shiroi kumo ga nagareru
chiheisen no mukou ni</i>

00:01:46.810 --> 00:01:54.780
<i>Beyond the horizon,
where the white clouds drift</i>

00:01:54.780 --> 00:02:06.520
<i>Naranderu mirai wa itsumo soba ni aru kara</i>

00:01:54.780 --> 00:02:06.520
<i>The future is lined up and
it'll always be there by my side</i>

00:02:22.650 --> 00:02:26.510
A doll? A ghost? What is it?

00:02:27.550 --> 00:02:30.610
My name is Fool. I am the Spirit of the Stage.

00:02:32.090 --> 00:02:34.960
Nothing to hear, nothing to hear,
I'm not hearing any weird voices.

00:02:34.960 --> 00:02:38.220
Nothing to see, nothing to see,
I'm not seeing anything weird!

00:02:40.700 --> 00:02:43.400
Oh, it's not there anymore. Thank goodness.

00:02:43.400 --> 00:02:44.920
