00:02:45.600 --> 00:02:51.170
Listen, if you can see me, it means that
you were chosen for the stage.

00:02:51.170 --> 00:02:53.140
And it's still talking!

00:02:53.140 --> 00:02:54.140
What is your name?

00:02:54.140 --> 00:02:57.980
Sora Naegino. Wait, I'm talking back to it!

00:02:59.050 --> 00:03:00.450
