apologize to Miss Layla?

00:14:56.230 --> 00:15:02.700
I gave up on joining Kaleido Stage earlier
because I missed the audition.

00:15:02.700 --> 00:15:07.640
But somehow I managed to get in.
So I really want to stay here!

00:15:07.640 --> 00:15:10.980
I don't ever want to give up again!

00:15:15.120 --> 00:15:15.920
Ow...

00:15:15.920 --> 00:15:19.150
If you think that hurts,
you still have a long way to go.

00:15:19.590 --> 00:15:21.280
He's still here.

00:15:30.170 --> 00:15:32.230
The reverse Chariot.

00:15:32.230 --> 00:15:36.530
This card indicates that things will end
in failure and you will taste defeat.

00:15:39.040 --> 00:15:42.180
However, even if the results
of a fortune telling are bad,

00:15:42.180 --> 00:15:43.700
the future can be changed.

00:15:47.750 --> 00:15:51.520
Depending on that person's efforts.

00:15:55.020 --> 00:15:59.830
Thus, in order to gain the muscle
strength to perform various tricks,

00:15:59.830 --> 00:16:02.860
you have to eat a low fat
and high protein diet.

00:16:02.860 --> 00:16:04.200
Could it be...

00:16:02.860 --> 00:16:04.200
you have to eat a low fat
and high protein diet.

00:16:04.200 --> 00:16:04.290
Could it be...

00:16:04.770 --> 00:16:06.760
She's working really hard?

00:16:15.180 --> 00:16:16.410
I did it!

00:16:16.410 --> 00:16:19.900
Okay, Sora. Next, you have to do it
while you're spinning.

00:16:21.680 --> 00:16:22.840
Sora!

00:16:23.950 --> 00:16:25.790
We brought you something to eat!

00:16:25.790 --> 00:16:27.890
I know you haven't eaten anything yet.

00:16:27.890 --> 00:16:29.050
Oh...

00:16:29.860 --> 00:16:31.120
How is it?

00:16:32.290 --> 00:16:34.100
It's delicious.

00:16:34.100 --> 00:16:36.630
I'm glad you liked it. Please have all of it.

00:16:36.630 --> 00:16:37.600
I will.

00:16:37.600 --> 00:16:39.360
I recommend this.

00:16:39.900 --> 00:16:42.270
Hot pepper drink?

00:16:42.800 --> 00:16:44.570
It'll give you energy.

00:16:46.040 --> 00:16:49.010
Anna, Mia, thank you.

00:16:49.010 --> 00:16:53.310
I'm sorry, Sora. It's all because l
mentioned the Golden Phoenix...

00:16:53.310 --> 00:16:55.150
No, don't worry about it.

00:16:55.150 --> 00:16:57.750
Because now, I have a chance
to prove myself.

00:16:57.750 --> 00:17:01.890
At first, I thought you were accepted
because you kissed up to the Boss,

00:17:01.890 --> 00:17:03.190
but I guess that wasn't the case.

00:17:03.190 --> 00:17:04.890
Sorry for misunderstanding.

00:17:04.890 --> 00:17:06.130
Don't worry about it.

00:17:06.130 --> 00:17:08.360
Oh, the bandage on your hand
is coming loose.

00:17:09.230 --> 00:17:10.930
Let me fix it for you.

00:17:10.930 --> 00:17:13.470
Good luck. We're rooting for you.

00:17:13.470 --> 00:17:14.730
Thank you.

00:17:15.970 --> 00:17:21.440
Swing the bar back and forth.
Spin, then jump.

00:17:21.440 --> 00:17:22.840
Is Sora okay?

00:17:23.440 --> 00:17:25.210
She's doing image training.

00:17:25.210 --> 00:17:28.820
She's picturing the image of the
perfected routine in her mind.

00:17:28.820 --> 00:17:30.350
I see.

00:17:30.350 --> 00:17:31.650
Finish.

00:17:32.720 --> 00:17:35.520
Therefore... Well, in other words...

00:17:36.160 --> 00:17:39.230
I'm listening to the lecture.
Please don't mind me.

00:17:39.230 --> 00:17:40.920
Even if you say so...

00:18:00.780 --> 00:18:02.510
Oh, Mr. Yuri!

00:18:03.750 --> 00:18:06.350
Where in the world were you looking at
when you jumped?

00:18:08.120 --> 00:18:11.130
There is no Juliet who is not always
gazing at her Romeo.

00:18:11.130 --> 00:18:13.720
That is why you are not Juliet.

00:18:21.440 --> 00:18:27.140
Mr. Yuri... I'm not completely
in the character of Juliet?

00:18:38.050 --> 00:18:41.260
So close! She almost made it.

00:18:41.260 --> 00:18:44.230
I can't believe she managed to do all this
in such a short time.

00:18:44.230 --> 00:18:46.390
If she can just grab the bar now...

00:18:46.390 --> 00:18:49.700
No, she still can't maintain a beautiful pose
in the air.

00:18:49.700 --> 00:18:51.370
Before she catches the bar,

00:18:51.370 --> 00:18:53.700
what she's doing can't be called
the Golden Phoenix.

00:18:54.170 --> 00:18:55.690
Go, Sora!

00:18:56.440 --> 00:18:57.930
By tomorrow...

00:18:59.310 --> 00:19:01.540
I have to perfect it by tomorrow.

00:19:03.780 --> 00:19:08.080
You couldn't perfect it after all,
but you did do your best.

00:19:08.550 --> 00:19:11.750
There's no knowing yet.
The real test is tomorrow.

00:19:13.590 --> 00:19:15.820
I haven't given up yet.

00:19:26.970 --> 00:19:30.530
I can't wait to see what kind of Golden
Phoenix she'll show us.

00:19:31.240 --> 00:19:32.540
Yeah.

00:19:36.780 --> 00:19:38.410
Thank you for coming to see me.

00:19:39.780 --> 00:19:43.310
I've got to do it.
I need to believe in myself.

00:19:51.960 --> 00:19:55.630
The bar should not be my aim.

00:19:55.630 --> 00:19:59.730
My aim should be my love, Romeo.

00:20:00.970 --> 00:20:04.340
And then, I can be Juliet.

00:20:07.140 --> 00:20:08.640
The Golden Phoenix!

00:20:08.640 --> 00:20:09.870
She did it!

00:20:36.170 --> 00:20:38.010
Sora, are you all right?

00:20:38.010 --> 00:20:39.730
Yes. Thank you.

00:20:40.640 --> 00:20:41.910
You're really something.

00:20:41.910 --> 00:20:43.430
Oh, Miss Layla.

00:20:44.010 --> 00:20:46.010
You didn't get the last part right,

00:20:46.010 --> 00:20:48.450
but that was definitely the Golden Phoenix.

00:20:48.450 --> 00:20:49.710
Huh?!

00:20:50.490 --> 00:20:52.720
I guess I have to
acknowledge you this time.

00:20:52.720 --> 00:20:54.160
What?

00:20:54.160 --> 00:20:55.850
Yuri, let's go.

00:20:56.390 --> 00:20:58.890
Sora, you can stay at Kaleido Stage now!

00:20:58.890 --> 00:20:59.960
Congratulations, Sora!

00:20:59.960 --> 00:21:01.490
I'm glad for you, Sora!

00:21:03.530 --> 00:21:05.000
I'm happy for you.

00:21:05.730 --> 00:21:09.030
I can stay at Kaleido Stage?

00:21:09.740 --> 00:21:11.230
Cheers!

00:21:14.480 --> 00:21:17.180
Aren't you happy now that you can stay
at Kaleido Stage, Sora?

00:21:17.180 --> 00:21:19.210
Yes, I am. Thank you.

00:21:19.210 --> 00:21:20.750
You're still here?!

00:21:20.750 --> 00:21:23.340
Sora, I think the three of you should
take a bath together.

00:21:24.290 --> 00:21:27.760
They say that true friendship starts
with sharing a bath together.

00:21:27.760 --> 00:21:30.090
If you are concerned about me, do not worry.

00:21:30.790 --> 00:21:32.390
That's enough!

00:21:32.390 --> 00:21:34.230
Ouch! What are you doing, Sora?!

00:21:34.230 --> 00:21:37.300
Oh, well. This is...

00:21:37.300 --> 00:21:39.500
Please stop it!

00:21:39.500 --> 00:21:41.000
What?

00:21:41.000 --> 00:21:45.810
That was a Japanese comedy routine I've
heard of called "tsukkomi".

00:21:45.810 --> 00:21:48.000
Yeah, that's right. That's right.

00:21:48.540 --> 00:21:51.010
Hey, you guys can't see him?

00:21:51.010 --> 00:21:52.600
What are you talking about?

00:21:56.550 --> 00:21:59.650
You're throwing a party? We can't have this.

00:21:59.650 --> 00:22:00.990
Dorm Supervisor.

00:22:00.990 --> 00:22:02.760
We're not allowed to have a party?

00:22:02.760 --> 00:22:05.630
Of course not, unless you invite me as well.

00:22:05.630 --> 00:22:07.890
That's the rule at this dormitory.

00:22:09.160 --> 00:22:10.260
Miss Sarah...

00:22:10.260 --> 00:22:11.400
Miss Sarah?!

00:22:11.400 --> 00:22:12.670
No way!

00:22:12.670 --> 00:22:15.600
Now, let's have some fun!

00:22:15.600 --> 00:22:17.400
The image I had of her...

00:22:21.840 --> 00:22:24.450
<i>When you sabishii toki doushitemasuka</i>

00:22:21.840 --> 00:22:24.450
<i>When you're lonely, what do you do?</i>

00:22:24.450 --> 00:22:26.850
<i>Never say sonna no wakannai</i>

00:22:24.450 --> 00:22:26.850
<i>Never say you don't get any of that</i>

00:22:26.850 --> 00:22:29.750
<i>Nemuru asobu magazine mekuru</i>

00:22:26.850 --> 00:22:29.750
<i>Sleep, play, flip through a magazine</i>

00:22:29.750 --> 00:22:32.050
<i>Sabishii toki wa sabishii yo</i>

00:22:29.750 --> 00:22:32.050
<i>When you're lonely, you're lonely</i>

00:22:32.050 --> 00:22:36.860
<i>Mienai denpa ga kyou mo
tulututu machi ni tobikau</i>

00:22:32.050 --> 00:22:36.860
<i>Like always, invisible vibes fly around
the city today, tulututu</i>

00:22:36.860 --> 00:22:41.530
<i>Anyway kokoro no bekutoru
so many reason hanashiteru</i>

00:22:36.860 --> 00:22:41.530
<i>Anyway, the vector of my heart is
talking about so many reasons</i>

00:22:41.530 --> 00:22:46.200
<i>Jiyuu ni sora o tobitai keredo</i>

00:22:41.530 --> 00:22:46.200
<i>I want to be free and fly the skies</i>

00:22:46.200 --> 00:22:50.870
<i>Hane o hirogeru basho ga nai</i>

00:22:46.200 --> 00:22:50.870
<i>But I don't have space to spread my wings</i>

00:22:50.870 --> 00:22:53.070
<i>Demo shinjiteru</i>

00:22:50.870 --> 00:22:53.070
<i>But I have faith</i>

00:22:53.070 --> 00:22:57.750
<i>Katachi no nai mirai ga aru yo</i>

00:22:53.070 --> 00:22:57.750
<i>There is a future yet to be shaped</i>

00:22:57.750 --> 00:23:02.420
<i>Katachi ni shitai watashi ga iru</i>

00:22:57.750 --> 00:23:02.420
<i>And there's a me that I want to shape</i>

00:23:02.420 --> 00:23:08.890
<i>Kanashikutemo machigai demo</i>

00:23:02.420 --> 00:23:08.890
<i>Even if I'm sad, even if it's a mistake</i>

00:23:08.890 --> 00:23:14.260
<i>Omou mama fly to the free</i>

00:23:08.890 --> 00:23:14.260
<i>I'll do what I want and
fly towards the freedom</i>

00:23:20.100 --> 00:23:21.530
Next Kaleido Star

00:23:22.570 --> 00:23:23.740
You don't have a role.

00:23:23.740 --> 00:23:27.170
And so, Kaleido Stage's
next theme is Cinderella.

00:23:27.170 --> 00:23:30.180
I heard that we newcomers
would also appear in it,

00:23:30.180 --> 00:23:32.010
but I'm the only one doesn't get a role?!

00:23:32.010 --> 00:23:33.150
It can't be.

00:23:33.150 --> 00:23:34.450
It must be some kind of mistake.

00:23:34.450 --> 00:23:36.350
But according to orders from Boss Kalos,

00:23:36.350 --> 00:23:39.250
I have to hand out candy
to children in the theater.

00:23:39.250 --> 00:23:41.860
I just gotta do it this time too! Gotta! Gotta!

00:23:41.860 --> 00:23:42.790
Next time on Kaleido Star,
"The Amazing Distant Stage."

00:23:42.790 --> 00:23:45.290
The Amazing Distant Stage

00:23:42.790 --> 00:23:45.290
Next time on Kaleido Star,
"The Amazing Distant Stage."

00:23:45.290 --> 00:23:47.780
The Amazing Distant Stage

00:23:45.290 --> 00:23:47.780
My wings are my dream
and on towards the sky...
